{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_2kja6ZqtTf1W2k1B7yy7uCnW","content":"145\t  [node hook]\n146\t  (assoc node :body (hook-application hook [(:body node)])))\n147\t\n148\t\n149\t(defn- rewrite\n150\t  \"The map AST `ast` with each `{path {:enter h :exit h}}` site's exit hook\n151\t   wrapped around its body and its entry hook prefixed. Throws when a site\n152\t   names no node, or a node that is not a lambda.\"\n153\t  [ast hooks]\n154\t  (let [seen (volatile! #{})]\n155\t    (letfn [(walk\n156\t              [node path]\n157\t              (let [slots (get vm/semantic-bytecode-grammar (:type node))\n158\t                    node (reduce\n159\t                           (fn [n [j [field kind]]]\n160\t                             (let [pos (+ j 2)]\n161\t                               (case kind\n162\t                                 :node (update n field walk (conj path pos))\n163\t                                 :nodes (update n field\n164\t                                                (fn [children]\n165\t                                                  (vec (map-indexed\n166\t                                                         (fn [i child]\n167\t                                                           (walk child (conj path [pos i])))\n168\t                                                         children))))\n169\t                                 n)))\n170\t                           node\n171\t                           (map-indexed vector slots))]\n172\t                (if-let [{:keys [enter exit statement?]} (get hooks path)]\n173\t                  (do (vswap! seen conj path)\n174\t                      (if statement?\n175\t                        (sequence-hook node enter)\n176\t                        (do (when-not (= :lambda (:type node))\n177\t                              (throw (ex-info \"Safepoint site is not a lambda\"\n178\t                                              {:rule :site-not-lambda, :path path,\n179\t                                               :type (:type node)})))\n180\t                            (cond-> node\n181\t                              exit (wrap-hook exit)\n182\t                              enter (prefix-hook enter)))))\n183\t                  node)))]\n184\t      (let [out (walk ast [])"}
